{"unit_id":"Quimos-M__dsh-sidebar-size#card-zh","repo":"Quimos-M/dsh-sidebar-size","commit":"ff9672260d80e892c469f3c067b5c23304656d40","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-size 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的右侧边栏宽度记忆插件。它通过客户端设置分组接入侧边栏与布局服务，观察宽度变化并把用户调整保存到本机存储。插件可按页签内容类型分别记忆宽度、在再次打开同类内容时恢复，并在缺少本类记录时沿上级内容类型查找可用宽度；也可切换为所有内容共用一套宽度。设置界面提供运行状态、宽度来源、数据重置以及导入导出能力，适合希望保持不同工作页布局习惯的 DSH 用户。安装后无需 API Key 或外部账号，数据保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:50-105","src/client/controller.ts:512-612","src/client/width-store.ts:35-116"]}
{"unit_id":"Quimos-M__dsh-sidebar-size#card-en","repo":"Quimos-M/dsh-sidebar-size","commit":"ff9672260d80e892c469f3c067b5c23304656d40","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-size remembers DSH web sidebar widths by tab type, restores them for similar tabs, and supports parent-width inheritance or one shared width. Settings show status and width origin and offer reset and data import/export. No API key is needed; data is kept in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:50-105","src/client/controller.ts:512-612","src/client/width-store.ts:35-116"]}
